  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to EuroCam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: Improve the ease-of-doing business in Mozambique and further diversify and increase trade between Mozambique and EU, as well as European investments in Mozambique.Specific objective: Strengthen the capacities of EuroCam, in line with their business plan, so that they can become the legitimate voice of European private sector in Mozambique in a sustainable way.</narrative>
  </description>
